      "content": "1.                                               HIGH STREET  839                                              (North Side)                                                  National Westminster No 222                                           Bank) SP 9907 NW 1/131 II 2.  Mid C19. Red brick buildings in Jacobean style. 2 storeys, tiled roof                                                                                                                                                                              with 5 gabled dormers and central Dutch gable. 4 lattice 3 light casements, central stone panel with shields over 4 centred arched doorway in stone.                                                                                                                Square plan cupola astride roof ridge. Listing NGR: SP9907307896"
